    "poster_id": 213285,
    "post_rendered": "Find the least positive integer <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\"  width=\"10\" height=\"8\" >,</span> such that there is a polynomial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/a/50a5e98c2a2da459b072557202f91f2cc41c7b5b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[ P(x) = a_{2n}x^{2n}+a_{2n-1}x^{2n-1}+\\dots+a_1x+a_0 \\]\"  width=\"352\" height=\"19\" > with real coefficients that satisfies both of the following properties:<br>\n- For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/b/14b3554b1b20d19a3775f4290ac2474102ad032d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i=0,1,\\dots,2n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"116\" height=\"16\" > it is <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/d/81dd918e3eec3e5d3de2811ae5b494e2bae53f0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2014 \\leq a_i \\leq 2015$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"135\" height=\"15\" >.</span><br>\n- There is a real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/f/ccfd1641d037d427d9dbf42cdd54b485a03eafe9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\xi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"8\" height=\"16\" > with <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/3/053d60b2278972c17bea75a2832c80a577a69695.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(\\xi)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"70\" height=\"18\" >.</span>",
    "post_canonical": "Find the least positive integer $n$, such that there is a polynomial \\[ P(x) = a_{2n}x^{2n}+a_{2n-1}x^{2n-1}+\\dots+a_1x+a_0 \\] with real coefficients that satisfies both of the following properties:\n      - For $i=0,1,\\dots,2n$ it is $2014 \\leq a_i \\leq 2015$.\n      - There is a real number $\\xi$ with $P(\\xi)=0$.",
